[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0263","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0263.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0616","title":"Faust Informatics FreeStyle Chat 4.1 SR2 MS-DOS 设备名拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 4.1 SR2 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标服务器发送包含 MS-DOS 设备名（如 AUX、CON、NUL 等）的特制 HTTP 请求（例如 GET /aux HTTP/1.0），触发服务器在处理这些保留设备名时发生异常，导致服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可实施，影响服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0616"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:38Z","remediation":"升级 Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 至 4.1 SR3 或更高版本，该版本已修复对 MS-DOS 设备名（如 AUX、CON、NUL）请求的处理逻辑。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置规则，拦截包含 MS-DOS 设备名的 URL 请求（如 /aux、/con、/nul、/prn 等），作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0241.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2777","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6602","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20883","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0616.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0616","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0616.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0616.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9h44-mprw-x9wq/GHSA-9h44-mprw-x9wq.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0616.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--59c81a2b-0379-470a-ad4e-9f923981196c.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0263.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0263.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0263.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0262","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0262.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0615","title":"Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 服务器 4.1 SR3 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含特殊构造的路径遍历序列（如 '...' 或 '....' 等变体）的 URL，绕过目录限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，可能导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者只需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0615"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:38Z","remediation":"升级 Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 服务器至 4.1 SR3 或更高版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置 URL 过滤规则，拦截包含 `..`、`...`、`....` 等路径遍历序列的请求，并限制应用程序对文件系统目录的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0241.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1841","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2776","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6601","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20882","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0615.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0615","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0615.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0615.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6m6j-2f5r-3rfw/GHSA-6m6j-2f5r-3rfw.json","https://github.com/yingdongucas/inconsistency_detection/blob/ae69c4fdb796e9540716e0fbf8686c5c8d29a42b/dataset/re_data/dirtra_full_dup.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0615.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f3b2eaf3-4409-466b-be76-678c832b3687.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0238","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0238.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0574","title":"Jason Rahaim MP3Mystic 目录遍历漏洞","description":"MP3Mystic 1.04b3 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中包含 '..'（点点）序列绕过路径限制，下载服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击条件简单，仅需向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可读取系统敏感文件，导致信息泄露。受影响版本为 MP3Mystic 1.0.x 系列，官方已在 1.04b3 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0574"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33Z","remediation":"升级 MP3Mystic 至 1.04b3 或更高版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置规则，拦截包含 `../` 的 URL 请求路径，并限制 Web 进程对文件系统的读取权限，仅允许访问公开目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0046.html","http://mp3mystic.com/mp3mystic/news.phtml","http://www.osvdb.org/1815","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2699","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6504","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20826","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0574.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0574","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0574.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0574.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x7mj-wjqj-jc9c/GHSA-x7mj-wjqj-jc9c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0574.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--62e6a573-d5b1-4f3c-8783-f3c5915bc12e.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0238.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0236","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0236.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0566","title":"Cisco Catalyst 2900XL Switch SNMP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 2900XL 系列交换机 SNMP 服务存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20）。当 SNMP 服务被禁用时，远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标设备的 UDP 161 端口发送特制的空数据包，触发服务处理异常，导致设备拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 12.0 及 '5.2'XU 版本的 Catalyst 2900XL 交换机，攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限，仅需网络可达即可实施攻击。Cisco 已发布相关安全公告，建议用户升级固件或配置访问控制列表（ACL）限制 SNMP 端口的访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0566"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco Catalyst 2900XL 交换机 IOS 至 12.0(5.2)XU 之后的修复版本；如无法升级，在交换机上配置 ACL 拒绝非信任源对 UDP 161 端口的访问：access-list 100 deny udp any any eq 161；若 SNMP 已禁用仍受影响，建议在边界防火墙上直接过滤入站 UDP 161 流量作为临时缓解。该设备已停产多年，强烈建议替换为受支持的 Catalyst 9000 系列交换机。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0040.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6515","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20824","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0566.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0566","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0566.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0566.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w4fp-j2mm-3rrv/GHSA-w4fp-j2mm-3rrv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88841/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0566.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--18cf2c24-9dd5-4d58-802d-c0011dd401b4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0236.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0235","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0235.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0565","title":"Oracle Solaris mailx 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 8及更早版本系统中的 mailx 程序存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 mailx 处理超长的 '-F' 命令行参数时，由于未对输入长度进行充分检查，导致缓冲区溢出，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而获取额外的系统权限。攻击者只需拥有本地 shell 访问权限即可触发该漏洞，无需身份认证。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5、2.6、7.0 及 8 等多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0565"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32Z","remediation":"升级到 Solaris 9 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可移除 mailx 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/mailx），限制本地普通用户通过 -F 参数触发缓冲区溢出。同时建议限制可登录系统的用户范围，仅允许受信任用户访问本地 shell。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0016.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/184210","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/446864","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2610","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8246","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20773","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0565.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0565","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0565.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0565.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4m9v-c2fv-vcv2/GHSA-4m9v-c2fv-vcv2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0565.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0235.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0231","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0231.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0563","title":"ElectroSoft ElectroComm Telnet 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ElectroSystems Engineering Inc. 出品的 ElectroComm 2.0 及更早版本的 Telnet 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的 23 端口发送超过 160000 个字符的超长字符串，导致 Telnet 服务崩溃或停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击门槛低，影响 ElectroComm 1.0/2.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0563"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32Z","remediation":"建议升级到 ElectroComm 2.0 以上版本（如厂商已停止支持，应迁移至替代产品）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上限制对 TCP 端口 23 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接；或禁用 Telnet 服务改用 SSH 替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0049.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2706","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6514","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20834","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0563.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0563","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0563.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0563.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qr36-6223-92fj/GHSA-qr36-6223-92fj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0563.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--46125085-41c2-4a33-b6e0-588ec4a97d01.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--46125085-41c2-4a33-b6e0-588ec4a97d01.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0231.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0229","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0561","title":"Drummond Miles A1Stats 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Drummond Miles A1Stats 1.0 及更早版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 a1disp2.cgi、a1disp3.cgi 或 a1disp4.cgi 脚本发送包含 '..'（点点）序列的特制请求，利用路径遍历攻击读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 A1Stats 1.6 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、系统文件等），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已发布 1.6 版本修复此问题，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0561"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32Z","remediation":"升级 A1Stats 至 1.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 a1disp2.cgi、a1disp3.cgi、a1disp4.cgi 中的目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面对上述 CGI 脚本的输入参数进行过滤，禁止包含 \"../\" 等路径穿越字符，并限制 CGI 脚本对文件系统的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0047.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/471691","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2705","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6503","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20833","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0561.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0561.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0561","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0561.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0561.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pwqq-cjfr-9p7q/GHSA-pwqq-cjfr-9p7q.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/a1stats.nasl","https://github.com/thetowsif/nuclei-template-fetcher/blob/a976ca2f195df8cbbe200182ad03f933a578bb92/community-templates/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0561.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0227","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0227.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0559","title":"Vixie Cron crontab 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Vixie cron 3.0.1 及更早版本中的 crontab 程序存在权限降低失败漏洞。当用户通过 crontab 命令修改计划任务时，若修改操作解析失败，程序未能正确降低特权级别，仍以高权限运行。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞，通过故意触发解析错误使编辑器以提升后的权限被调用，从而获取额外的系统权限。该漏洞影响 Linux/Unix 系统中广泛使用的 Vixie cron 任务调度组件，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低，可导致完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0559"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32Z","remediation":"升级 Vixie cron 至 3.0pl1-58 或更高版本（Debian 对应 DSA-054 安全更新）。如无法立即升级，限制本地用户对 crontab 命令的访问权限，仅允许受信任用户使用，并监控 /var/spool/cron 目录的异常修改行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-054","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-050.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_017_cron_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/183029","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2687","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6508","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0559.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0559.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0559","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0559.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0559.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-054.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xxwc-wcp3-hfp4/GHSA-xxwc-wcp3-hfp4.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_200_300.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-054.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0227.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0224","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0224.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0558","title":"T. Hauck Jana Server MS-DOS 设备名拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0558漏洞影响T. Hauck Jana Server 1.45/1.46/2.0及更高版本的Web服务器，该服务器在处理HTTP请求时对MS-DOS设备名称（如aux/prn等）进行不安全的检查。当攻击者向目标服务器发送包含MS-DOS设备名（例如GET /aux HTTP/1.0）的URL请求时，服务器会导致请求处理堆栈异常进而崩溃或停止服务，实现远程拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞是一种基于原始网络输入的内存访问控制缺陷，攻击者无需身份验证即可通过简单的HTTP请求触发。当服务器启动时，对于/MS-DOS风格的设备名称，服务器并未正确处理它们，导致系统资源耗尽或服务不可用。该漏洞影响Windows平台下的Jana Web服务器，攻击可能导致服务器完全不可用，影响企业业务连续性和网络服务稳定性。攻击者可以轻松利用这种简单的请求就能达到破坏服务的效果，攻击方式极其简单直接，迫使管理员紧急采取服务中断等措施应对，极大的影响了系统的可用性。因此，这是一个低复杂度、可直接远程利用的拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者无需任何权限或特殊工具，只需构造一个包含MS-DOS设备名的简单HTTP请求，即可使受害服务器崩溃或停止响应，完全暴露了该Web服务器对URL路径进行不安全检查的安全缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0558"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31Z","remediation":"升级到 Jana Server 2.01 正式版或更高版本，该版本已修复 MS-DOS 设备名称请求导致的崩溃问题。如暂无法升级，应在防火墙或反向代理层过滤包含 MS-DOS 设备名称（CON、AUX、PRN、COM1、LPT1 等）的 HTTP 请求路径，或暂时关闭 Jana Server 面向公网的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0086.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1817","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2704","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6521","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20830","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0558.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0558","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0558.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0558.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x8w9-p5vr-g9q8/GHSA-x8w9-p5vr-g9q8.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/http_w98_devname_dos.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0558.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0224.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0224.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0224.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0222","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0557","title":"T. Hauck Jana Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"T. Hauck Jana Server 1.46 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 Web 服务器发送经过十六进制编码的 \"..\"（即 %2e%2e）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制，读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Jana Server 1.46 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者利用此漏洞可获取系统敏感信息，为后续攻击提供铺垫。目前已有公开的 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0557"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 T. Hauck Jana Server 至 1.46 以上版本，该版本已修复 URL 编码的目录遍历问题。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层添加规则，对请求路径中的 `%2e%2e`、`%2e/` 等编码后的路径穿越序列进行解码拦截。若产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache 或 Nginx 等活跃维护的 Web 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0086.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/132099","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2703","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6513","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20829","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0557.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0557.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0557","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0557.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0557.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-982w-46v4-62v7/GHSA-982w-46v4-62v7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0557.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2703/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e97a209f-6f0d-48d3-aba5-f6aae086c19f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0220","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0220.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0555","title":"ScreamingMedia SITEWare 目录遍历漏洞","description":"ScreamingMedia SITEWare 2.5 至 3.1 版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在 SITEWare Editor's Desktop 或 SWEditServlet 的 template 参数中构造 `../` 序列进行路径穿越，可读取服务器上任意可读文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0555"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 ScreamingMedia SITEWare 至 3.1 以上版本（厂商已发布补丁 sms1001.php）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面限制对 SWEditServlet 和 Editor's Desktop 的访问（如通过 .htaccess 或防火墙仅允许可信 IP），并对 template 参数进行严格的路径过滤，拒绝包含 \"../\" 或空字节的请求。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的 Web 内容管理平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0165.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0166.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/795707","http://www.osvdb.org/13887","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2869","http://www01.screamingmedia.com/en/security/sms1001.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6689","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20925","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0555.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0555","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0555.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0555.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mwp3-rx54-m69v/GHSA-mwp3-rx54-m69v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0555.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7b1d9ff0-bf43-4697-a29e-0f9eb487c068.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/04a9a8381d346b006d2615d73d55f4e286759f63/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0219","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0219.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0554","title":"多厂商 TelnetD 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"多个 BSD 基础的操作系统中的 Telnet 守护程序 (Telnet Daemon, telnetd) 存在严重缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过发送特制选项（包括 AYT（Are You There）命令）触发 telrcv 函数的未验证输入导致内存缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。受影响的操作系统包括 Solaris 2.x/7.0/8、IRIX 6.5.x、OpenBSD 2.x、NetBSD 1.x、Debian 3 和 HP-UX 10，所有版本均存在该漏洞。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用此漏洞，CVSS 评分高达 10.0（CVSS：AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），对系统的保密性、完整性和可用性构成完全破坏。该漏洞源于 TelnetD 在处理协议选项时缺乏长度检查，攻击者可通过精心构造的网络包触发缓冲区溢出。操作系统厂商已发布安全补丁，建议用户升级到最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0554"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31Z","remediation":"建议立即禁用 telnet 服务并改用 SSH 协议（如 OpenSSH 3.4+），在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 23 端口；若必须保留 telnet，请升级至各厂商修复版本：Solaris 8 安装补丁 108968-18、108993-18；OpenBSD 升级至 3.0+；NetBSD 升级至 1.5.2+；Debian 3.0 安装 telnetd_0.17-14.1 补丁包（DSA-070）；HP-UX 10.20 安装 PHNE_22621；IRIX 6.5.x 安装补丁 3521；Gentoo 执行 emerge --update net-misc/netkit-telnetd（GLSA-200410-03）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2001-q4/0014.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000413","http://ftp.support.compaq.com/patches/.new/html/SSRT0745U.shtml","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3476","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/